# wtEncodeFrameHeader(id=1, ptsMicros=0, key=false, config=true)
#
# pts is 0 -- see trap 31 and docs/protocol.md. Pinned against
# wtConn.nextFrameHeader, the exact call SendFrame makes, by
# TestFrameGoldenWTConfig in internal/httpapi/golden_test.go.
#
# bytes 0-3  frameID    00000001            1, big endian
